    <briefdescription>
<para>Incremental Evolution Scenario 5: Audit Trail Under High Churn. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Tests incremental evolution tracking with 500+ entries per second.</para>
<para><bold>Setup:</bold><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>5-node cluster</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>10,000+ model mutations (audit trail entries)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Concurrent reads and writes to audit trail</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><bold>Execution:</bold><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Append 10,000 entries at high rate (500+/sec)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Concurrently read random entries</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Verify CRC32 checksums for all entries</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Compute snapshot index</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><bold>Verification:</bold><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>All entries persisted and retrievable</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>CRC32 chain valid for all entries</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Snapshot index correctly maps time ranges</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>No gaps or duplicates in entry sequence</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Concurrent reads do not block writes</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><bold>Expected P95:</bold> &lt;10ms per append, &lt;1ms per read </para>
    </detaileddescription>
